  "translation": "In the morning, I got up and first drank water. Then I ate breakfast; I ate bread and eggs. My friend Xiao Ming also came, and he asked me, 'Shall we go to the supermarket together?' I said, 'Okay.' We went to the supermarket from home. There were many people in the supermarket. We bought apples, milk, and bananas. The apples were the cheapest, the milk was too expensive. We also bought eggs. Xiao Ming asked, 'How much altogether?' I said, 'Thirty yuan.' Then we went home. After going home, I can cook. I made eggs and rice, and Xiao Ming said it was really delicious. I can eat a lot. We were all very happy."
